---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact
summary: Write to EV News Desk. No street address is published.
permalink: /contact/
---
<p>Email the {{ site.author }} at <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>.</p>
{% if site.contactEmail | isPlaceholderEmail %}
<p class="note">This address is a placeholder in the site configuration. Change <code>contactEmail</code> in <code>src/_data/site.js</code> before launch.</p>
{% endif %}
<p>{{ site.name }} is owned and operated by {{ site.operator }}, {{ site.entityDescription }}. We do not publish a street address.</p>
<h2>What to send</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Corrections: the article URL, the passage, and a link to a public source. The policy is on the <a href="{{ '/corrections/' | url }}">corrections page</a>.</li>
  <li>Tips: documents or pages a reader can open, not a claim with nowhere to check it.</li>
  <li>Replies go to the address you used. There is no account and no mailing list on this site.</li>
</ul>
